# Trivy ignore list for .github/workflows/container-scan.yml (PRD-08).
#
# Rules: every entry needs a justification and an expiry (`exp:YYYY-MM-DD`).
# Trivy stops honouring an entry after its expiry, so a forgotten ignore turns the
# gate red again instead of hiding the finding. Never add an entry without a link
# to the follow-up that removes it.

